# The open graphics stack: Mesa's nouveau driver renders on the GM20B and its
# tegra driver puts the result on the display (tegra-drm). Debian's Mesa does
# not enumerate the Tegra GPU in NVK; Vulkan is a later phase (docs/mainline.md).
libgl1-mesa-dri
libglx-mesa0
libegl-mesa0
libgbm1
mesa-vulkan-drivers

# Diagnosis on the device (glxinfo, eglinfo, vulkaninfo)
mesa-utils
vulkan-tools
